{"unit_id":"qjcnmd__dsh-reasoning-slider#feature-model-menu","repo":"qjcnmd/dsh-reasoning-slider","commit":"f958b44adb3e0ea28a3590f3609f12222ba91842","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"reasoning-slider 的模型菜单按供应商分组列出可用模型，并显示模型名称、可选描述及当前选择状态。用户点击选项即可切换；加载中、列表为空和操作出错时会显示相应状态，错误区域提供重试。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:296-322"]}
{"unit_id":"qjcnmd__dsh-reasoning-slider#feature-effort-slider","repo":"qjcnmd/dsh-reasoning-slider","commit":"f958b44adb3e0ea28a3590f3609f12222ba91842","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"reasoning-slider 为当前模型提供推理等级滑块，拖动时预览档位，松开后提交选择；方向键和滚轮也能逐档调整。控件标注当前值，并针对最大档位显示强调效果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:72-167"]}
{"unit_id":"qjcnmd__dsh-reasoning-slider#feature-preserve-effort","repo":"qjcnmd/dsh-reasoning-slider","commit":"f958b44adb3e0ea28a3590f3609f12222ba91842","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"切换模型时，reasoning-slider 会检查目标模型是否支持当前推理等级；若支持则沿用，否则采用目标模型声明的默认等级，或选择可用等级中间项。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:262-282"]}
